  "description": "Operating Area: Italy\n\nANIMA is a Fountaine Pajot Power 80, the flagship of the shipyard’s motor yacht collection and the only one available for charter in Italy. She brings superyacht comfort and capability to the luxury power catamaran market.\n\nWith accommodation for up to 8 guests, ANIMA offers 4 cabins, including a Master suite, one VIP cabin, and two double guest cabins, all with ensuite bathrooms. Her professional crew of 4 delivers a seamless onboard experience with attentive, discreet service.\n\nThe yacht’s 250 square metres of entertaining space provide multiple areas for relaxation. The foredeck features a jacuzzi and sun loungers, while the aft cockpit connects naturally to the saloon, creating a fluid indoor–outdoor living environment. The flybridge extends the experience with panoramic sea views and an ideal setting for alfresco dining or navigation in comfort.\n\nPowered by twin engines up to 900 hp, ANIMA delivers both range and reliability, capable of comfortable long-distance cruising or relaxed coastal itineraries. Her modern systems and stable twin-hull design ensure a quiet, smooth ride for guests at all times.\n\nExclusive, spacious, and versatile, ANIMA offers a unique opportunity to explore the Amalfi Coast and the wider Mediterranean aboard the most advanced Power 80 in existence - a yacht where contemporary design meets genuine seagoing performance.",
